<title>USA: Interim Services to acquire two firms.</title>
<headline>Interim Services to acquire two firms.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interim Services Inc said on Tuesday it has agreed to acquire two groups of staffing companies in The Netherlands, marking its entrance into the European commercial staffing market.</p>
<p>The companies, Allround and Interplan, have a total of six locations and combined revenues of approximately $15 million for fiscal year 1995.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to close within the next 30 days. Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The Dutch offices will change their names to Interim in six months, the company said.</p>
